d to have origins in Taoist and Legalist traditions."},"defenceVal":"12","mp":"1800","price":"18000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1025505","name":{"zh":"国师冠","en":"Imperial Tutor Crown"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"被赐予国师这一特殊称号的人会被同时赐予的礼冠，因此十分罕见。","en":"A ceremonial crown bestowed along with the special epithet of Imperial Preceptor, making it extremely rare."},"defenceVal":"6","mp":"1600","price":"9500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10182","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ10074","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI104315","name":{"zh":"巨鹿张氏","en":"The Zhang clan of Julu"},"years":["180","200"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，张氏为巨鹿著姓，世传方术。黄巾起义领袖，开创中国首次宗教大起义。“苍天已死，黄天当立”，震动天下。","en":"Descended from the Ji surname, the Zhang clan was a prominent Family in Julu that passed down esoteric arts for generations. Leaders of the Yellow Turban Rebellion, they initiated China's first major religious uprising. Their rallying cry, ‘The Azure Sky is dead, the Yellow Sky shall rise,’ shook the realm."},"talent":{"military":"6","commerce":"2","politics":"3"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10074","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[81,84,74,62,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"120","reputation":"9300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[81,84,74,62,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"120","reputation":"9300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902",