d":"plot","id":"1080102","name":{"zh":"全国辩论大赛","en":"National Debate Contest"},"year":"0","month":"0","desc":{"zh":"全国辩论大赛已经拉开帷幕，若有意参与请尽快前往。","en":"The National Debate Contest has begun. Head there at once if you wish to participate."}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1080202","name":{"zh":"全国群辩大赛","en":"National Team Debate"},"year":"0","month":"0","desc":{"zh":"全国群辩大赛已经拉开帷幕，若有意参与请尽快前往。","en":"The National Team Debate has begun. Head there at once if you wish to participate."}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1009602","name":{"zh":"全国演兵大会","en":"National War Games"},"year":"0","month":"0","desc":{"zh":"全国演兵大会已经拉开帷幕，若有意参与请尽快前往。","en":"The National War Games have begun. Head there at once if you wish to participate."}}],"biography":{"zh":"黄巾之乱的领导者之一，排行第三，张角、张宝之弟，自封人公将军。与张宝颍川一同迎战前来镇压的朝廷大将朱儁，被火攻所败。在张角病死后，迅速整合冀州黄巾军残部，以广宗为核心构建防线，与皇甫嵩率领的东汉精锐长期对峙。被夜袭溃败后遭皇莆嵩与曹操追击，多次抵抗无果终被围杀。","tc":"黃巾之亂的領導者之一，排行第三，張角、張寶之弟，自封人公將軍。與張寶潁川一同迎戰前來鎮壓的朝廷大將朱儁，被火攻所敗。在張角病死后，迅速整合冀州黃巾軍殘部，以廣宗為核心構建防線，與皇甫嵩率領的東漢精銳長期對峙。被夜襲潰敗后遭皇莆嵩與曹操追擊，多次抵抗無果終被圍殺。","en":"One of the leaders of the Yellow Turban Rebellion, the third of the brothers—younger brother to Zhang Jiao and Zhang Bao—and self-styled General of Man. Alongside Zhang Bao, he met the Imperial general Zhu Jun at Yingchuan, but was defeated by a fire attack. After Zhang Jiao died of illness, he swiftly consolidated the remnants of the Yellow Turban army in Ji Province, building a defensive line centered on Guangzong and engaging in a prolonged standoff with Huangfu Song's elite troops. Routed in a night attack, he was pursued by Huangfu Song and Cao Cao. Despite repeated resistance, he was ultimately surrounded and killed.","jp":"黄巾の乱の指導者の一人。序列は三番目で、張角・張宝の弟。自ら人公将軍を称した。張宝と共に潁川で鎮圧に赴いた朝廷の大将・朱儁を迎え撃つも、火攻めに遭い敗北した。張角の病死後は速やかに冀州の黄巾軍残党を再編し、広宗を拠点として防衛線を構築、皇甫嵩率いる東漢の精鋭と長期にわたり対峙した。夜襲を受けて敗走した後は皇甫嵩と曹操の追撃を受け、幾度も抗戦するも及ばず、最期は包囲されて討ち取られた。","kr":"황건의 난을 이끈 지도자 중 한 명으로, 장각과 장보의 아우이자 셋째이다. 스스로 인공장군이라 일컬었다. 영천에서 장보와 함께 토벌에 나선 조정의 대장 주준을 맞아 싸웠으나 화공에 패했다. 장각이 병사한 뒤에는 기주 황건군의 잔당을 신속히 규합하고 광종을 중심으로 방어선을 구축하여, 황보숭이 이끄는 동한의 정예군과 장기간 대치했다. 야습을 당해 패퇴한 후 황보숭과 조조의 추격을 받았으며, 수차례 저항했으나 결국 포위되어 목숨을 잃었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10181","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"梁","nameTc":"梁","nameEn":"Liang","nameJp":"梁","nameKr":"양","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张梁","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"3","workYear":"184","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"81","force":"84","wise":"74","politics":"62","charm":"82","will":"85","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"30/30/30/80/30/22/50/30","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1001402;1010802;1010702","battleSkill":"1001000;1002102","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1001305;S1007305","battleSoul":"1012105","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"7000","battleSoulPoint":"6400","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"1002515","strategy2":"1005001","professions":"0/4/3/0/3/0/2/0/0/0/3/3/2/0/4/3/0/1/2/0/0/2/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"4","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"-7000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"153","show":"184","death":"184","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025505","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;18/1;25/1;39/1;57/1;10/0;43/0;30/2;21/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ10182/100;WJ10074/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"1","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description